#. 体の調子がおかしい…
#. しばらく休まないと駄目そうだ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'm feeling really...out of whack. It might be a good\n"
"idea for me to get some rest..."
msgstr ""

#. 僕とした事が…
#. 体調管理を怠ってしまったようだ…
msgctxt "0002 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"In my fervor to do a good job, I seem to have\n"
"neglected my health..."
msgstr ""

#. なぜこの俺が肉体労働など…
#. チッ…あとはお前らでなんとかするんだな！
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Why should I subject myself to manual labor? Tch...\n"
"You can do the rest yourselves!"
msgstr ""

#. あー、ダリぃ…
#. しばらく休ませてもらうぜ…
msgctxt "0004 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Ahh, I'm all tapped out. I need to go lay down for a\n"
"while..."
msgstr ""

#. マジでやってらんねー！
#. オレはもう働かねーかんな！！
msgctxt "0005 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "I seriously can't do this anymore! I quit!"
msgstr ""

#. これ以上の労働は勘弁してください…
#. 死んでしまいますぞ…
msgctxt "0006 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Please, no more... No more! I'm gonna die...!"
msgstr ""

#. 今日は星の巡りが悪いべ…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "The stars must be out of alignment for me today..."
msgstr ""

#. すみません…
#. ちょっと、頑張り過ぎちゃったみたいです…
msgctxt "0008 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Sorry... I think I pushed myself a little too hard."
msgstr ""

#. さすがに限界ね…
#. 少し休ませてもらえる…？
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think I've reached my limit. Is it okay if I take a\n"
"little break?"
msgstr ""

#. 駄目だぁ、元気が出ない…
#. ドーナツ分が足りないよ…
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It's no use... I'm all out of energy! I think one more\n"
"donut would finish the job, but..."
msgstr ""

#. も、もう嫌よ…
#. いつまで…こんな生活が続くのよッ！
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I-I can't keep this up... How long are we g-gonna be\n"
"stuck living like this...!?"
msgstr ""

#. すまぬ、オーバーワークのようだ…
#. しばらく休ませてもらおう…
msgctxt "0012 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I pushed myself a little too hard. I need some\n"
"time to recover."
msgstr ""

#. さすがに、うんざりしてきましたわね…
#. 気分も乗りません…
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I no longer feel like doing this. Frankly, I am fed up\n"
"with this entire endeavor."
msgstr ""

#. なんか、すっごいダルいんですけど…
#. 休んでるから後はよろしく…
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"I'm feelin' totally wiped. Sorry, can you guys take it\n"
"from here?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのぉ…少し体調が悪いみたいなんだ…
#. お休みさせてもらってもいいかなぁ…
msgctxt "0015 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"U-Um...sorry, but I'm not feeling too well. Would you\n"
"hate me if I took a little break...?"
msgstr ""
